Hermione was growing tired, unused to talking for so long-a first for her.

"He took me to be interrogated by Vo-Voldemort. He tortured me but I didn't tell him anything."
Hermione did not tell them about what else he had done.
"He was already violent before but when his mother died he grew more unstable. He started making
offers, trying to tempt me to give in to him but I refused. For that he began giving me Amortentia.
