"We looked for you everywhere once we found out," Harry said. "We also went to the school to
look for the Horcrux; we didn't realize the battle was happening on the same day."

Hermione nodded and looked down into her lap again. Now came the hard part.

"I was in the courtyard, behind the rubble because I didn't want to be seen. I heard them say Harry
was dead, and I kind of collapsed. After I got up Voldemort's snake found me. It chased me and
would have eaten me but someone came and cut its head off with a sword. I didn't get a look at who
